[size=6]Rejoin[/size]
🛟 [b]Need help or found a bug?[/b] Get support at [url=https://support.doodesch.de/rejoin]support.doodesch.de/rejoin[/url].

[b]Game crashed halfway through a round? Pick up where you left off.[/b]

Rejoin adds a new card on the left of the main menu. Select [b]Rejoin[/b], then [b]Reconnect[/b] to return to your interrupted round. Your cards, turn and room changes are kept. You choose when to return.

[b]Early development state.[/b] This is an early version and you may run into bugs. Rejoining after a host's game crash has been tested locally. A full test with four different players and a real AMD driver crash has not yet been completed. Please report problems using the support link above.

[size=5]Getting back into a round[/size]
[list]
[*] If a guest's game crashes, start the game again through Steam and use [b]Rejoin > Reconnect[/b].
[*] If the host's game crashes, the round stays running in the background. The host's main menu opens again so they can reconnect too.
[*] The Rejoin card appears when a previous session is available. It never forces you back into a round.
[/list]

[size=5]Install[/size]
[list=1]
[*] Close the game.
[*] Extract the complete ZIP.
[*] Run [b]Installieren.bat[/b].
[*] Start the game normally through Steam.
[/list]
Install Rejoin on every player's PC and use the same mod version. UE4SS is included, so you do not need to install it separately. Keep [b]Installieren.bat[/b] with the other extracted files. The first installation needs an internet connection. Afterwards, start the game normally through Steam.

[size=5]Before you play[/size]
[list]
[*] Rejoin keeps a round alive after a game crash. It does not prevent game or driver crashes.
[*] The host's PC must stay on. If it shuts down, restarts or the background session crashes, the round is lost. Rejoin does not save rounds for later.
[*] When the host chooses [b]Quit Game[/b], the round ends for everyone. Hosting a new round also ends their previous one.
[/list]

This version is for [b]Windows and the Steam version of the game, build 25553694[/b]. The installer checks the game version and stops if it finds conflicting files. Other mods that change the main menu or multiplayer may conflict with Rejoin.

[size=5]Need help or want to uninstall?[/size]
The included README explains how to remove Rejoin and where to find logs for a bug report. If you use other UE4SS mods, keep their shared UE4SS files.

[size=5]Credits[/size]
Rejoin by [b]DooDesch[/b]. UE4SS by the UE4SS contributors. Both licenses are included in the download.
